#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:1
msgid "Configuration attribute"
msgstr "設定アトリビュート"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:3
msgid ""
"The `#cfg` attribute controls whether a declaration is included in "
"compilation. Conditions are evaluated at compile time and can use:"
msgstr ""
"`#cfg` アトリビュートは、宣言をコンパイルに含めるかどうかを制御します。条件は"
"コンパイル時に評価され、次のものを使用できます："

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:6
msgid "`true` or `false` to always include or exclude a declaration."
msgstr "`true` または `false`：宣言を常に含めるか除外します。"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:7
msgid "`target` to select a compilation backend, such as `target=\"wasm\"`."
msgstr ""
"`target`：`target=\"wasm\"` のようにコンパイルバックエンドを選択します。"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:8
msgid ""
"`platform` to select an operating system for the native backend, such as "
"`platform=\"windows\"`."
msgstr ""
"`platform`：`platform=\"windows\"` のように native バックエンドのオペレーティ"
"ングシステムを選択します。"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:10
msgid ""
"`not(...)`, `all(...)`, or `any(...)` to negate a condition, require all "
"conditions, or require at least one condition."
msgstr ""
"`not(...)`、`all(...)`、`any(...)`：それぞれ条件の否定、すべての条件の成立、"
"少なくとも一つの条件の成立を表します。"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:14
msgid ""
"A `platform` condition currently also restricts the target to `native`. For "
"example, `platform=\"windows\"` is equivalent to `all(target=\"native\", "
"platform=\"windows\")`."
msgstr ""
"`platform` 条件を指定すると、現時点では target も `native` に制限されます。た"
"とえば、`platform=\"windows\"` は `all(target=\"native\", "
"platform=\"windows\")` と同じ意味です。"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:18
msgid ""
"This matters under negation: `not(platform=\"windows\")` also matches every "
"non-native target. To select native builds other than Windows, use "
"`all(target=\"native\", not(platform=\"windows\"))`."
msgstr ""
"否定する場合はこの点に注意してください。`not(platform=\"windows\")` は、"
"`native` 以外のすべての target にも一致します。Windows 以外の native ビルドだ"
"けを選択するには、`all(target=\"native\", not(platform=\"windows\"))` を使用"
"してください。"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:25
msgid ""
"#cfg(true)\n"
"fn cfg_true() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"#cfg(false)\n"
"fn cfg_false() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"#cfg(target=\"wasm\")\n"
"fn cfg_wasm() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"#cfg(platform=\"windows\")\n"
"fn cfg_native_windows() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"#cfg(not(platform=\"windows\"))\n"
"fn cfg_except_native_windows() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"#cfg(all(target=\"native\", not(platform=\"windows\")))\n"
"fn cfg_native_non_windows() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"#cfg(any(target=\"wasm\", target=\"native\"))\n"
"fn cfg_any() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
